WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.230
Manila. A dense, humid metropolis where heat can close schools.

2
00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:11.860
In April 2024, over five thousand Philippine schools moved to remote learning.

3
00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:17.060
Quezon City has a heat action team, and libraries as cooling centres.

4
00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:21.560
Cooler classrooms keep children learning.
